{"body":{"model":"fable","reads":{"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000000"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BJ"},"understandings":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CN"}]},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BH","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000J"],"name":"branch-13"}
{"body":{"matters":"what is settled at runtime rather than at design time","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"}],"prose":"Everything the paper builds answers one pressure: a collection of parts must hold together while none of what holds it is fixed in advance, not the shared vocabulary, not the allocation of roles, not even who directs the trial run. Each column of the work moves some decision from design time to the moment of use.","title":"Coherence without a settled centre"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority sits","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BP"}],"prose":"The holon is inherited, not invented here: a unit that is a whole to what it contains and a part to what contains it, with authority running down the nesting and autonomy kept at every level. The paper takes this form as given and asks it to carry new weights.","title":"A borrowed form: whole and part at once"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"position in the nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000116"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"}],"prose":"The distinction from an agent is positional: an agent is free in a flat field, a holon is free within a place in a nesting. Higher places command, lower places execute, yet each keeps a local say, and global behaviour is meant to arise from that constrained freedom rather than from a centre.","title":"The pyramid that keeps its parts free"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the domain the form has crossed into","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"The form was first put to work on machines, cells and operators in a factory, then carried into grids, building sites and supply chains. The paper's own move is one more step of that outward drift, to territories and the public services that cross them.","title":"From the factory floor outward"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which shortfall is named","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Four complaints are lodged against autonomous systems as they stand: they do not generalise when conditions shift, they carry bias, they cannot reason about responsibility, and they see too little of their surroundings. The holonic nesting is offered as the frame into which remedies for each can be slotted.","title":"The shortfalls the form is asked to mend"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BP","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision can lack","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C0"}],"prose":"The five proposed dimensions are best read not as five kinds of holon but as five faults a decision can have: it can be wrong, short-sighted, uncomprehending, prejudiced, or blind to the rest of the system. Each fault is given a part whose job is to catch it.","title":"Five ways a decision can fall short"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the quality a single part carries","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000BX"}],"prose":"Each dimension is presented on the same template: a lack in current systems, a holon named for the quality, a method of ontologies and models, two domains of example, two challenges. The sameness of the template is itself a claim that these qualities are of one kind.","title":"The five taken one at a time"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BR","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what a rule forbids","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"}],"prose":"Moral and legal limits are to be encoded as ontologies and rules so that they can be weighed beside operational goals rather than after them. The part that carries them is meant to refuse opportunistic coalitions, not merely to flag them.","title":"Right and wrong as a constraint"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BS","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how far ahead the cost is counted","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"}],"prose":"Efficiency counts the cost of reaching a goal; effectiveness counts what the goal costs afterward. The distinction is drawn as a difference in how far ahead a decision looks, and it is to be made operational with weighted utilities and goal hierarchies.","title":"The horizon of a consequence"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BT","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much structure the input arrives with","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"}],"prose":"Understanding is defined operationally as turning heterogeneous, incomplete input into situational knowledge through ontologies and inference, with learned models allowed to enrich the symbols. The quality is less about insight than about structure imposed on arriving data.","title":"Meaning drawn from noisy data"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where a bias enters","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"}],"prose":"Bias is treated as a nameable pattern: ontologies of known biases, fairness constraints, audits after the fact. The part that carries this is placed inside the decision loop so that checking is continuous rather than a review at the end.","title":"Prejudice caught in the loop"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how far a part can see","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"}],"prose":"The last quality is awareness of what other parts and the whole are doing, carried by distributed sensing and shared state models. A part may be well informed about its own task and still misaligned with the system; vigilance is the correction for that gap.","title":"Seeing further than one's own place"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a quality can be told by its instance","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"}],"prose":"The vehicle and pandemic illustrations appear word for word under both the ethical and the effective dimension. The repetition is telling: by their instances the two qualities cannot be told apart, which suggests the boundary between them lives in the method, not in the world.","title":"The example that would not stay put"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"defining, measuring, balancing","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Every dimension ends by confessing the same three difficulties: the quality must be defined, measured, and balanced against efficiency or speed. Read together, the challenge paragraphs are one admission repeated five times.","title":"What each quality costs to make real"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000BZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"who feeds whom","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"The five are given a flow: ethical and unbiased checks feed the effective decision, understanding supplies both with context, and vigilance watches over all layers. The flow makes the qualities a small holarchy of their own before any connector is introduced.","title":"How the qualities feed one another"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much must be shared beforehand","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000C9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CB"}],"prose":"The paper's central proposal is that parts which were never designed together can still understand each other if agreement is produced when they meet and discarded afterward. A dedicated part is given the job of producing it.","title":"Meaning made at the moment of contact"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is standardised in advance","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"}],"prose":"Systems can share one format, share a mapping layer, or share nothing and translate at the border. The three options are ordered by how much is standardised before any exchange, and the paper chooses the end of the scale where nothing is.","title":"Three ways to interoperate"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"autonomy kept per part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"A nesting of autonomous parts cannot accept a global model without losing the autonomy that defines it, so the only interoperability it can bear is one negotiated at runtime. The argument is structural: the form of the system selects the form of the agreement.","title":"Why the federated way fits nested wholes"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a shared meaning must last","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"A shared vocabulary is built for one task phase or exchange, used, and thrown away, a temporary contract rather than a standing dictionary. Its brevity is what keeps it cheap and what lets strangers join without a prior agreement.","title":"Meaning with a short life"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how fast a system must re-form","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"}],"prose":"Across the examples the same figure recurs: an earthquake, an accident on the road, a supply disruption, a discrepancy in a run. Each is the moment a configuration ceases to fit, and the whole apparatus is sized for the speed at which it must re-form after that moment.","title":"The unforeseen event"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which organ each quality becomes","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"}],"prose":"The interoperability holon is introduced as glue between the five qualities and then, within a page, is found to be their superholon, with the five recruited as its organs: the unbiased part for retrieval, the ethical part as a validation layer, the vigilant part as orchestrator. Connecting things turns out to mean standing above them.","title":"The connector that becomes the top"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which difference is bridged","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"}],"prose":"Five duties are listed: translate, align goals, pool data, arbitrate conflict, and reconfigure. Each names a different kind of difference between parts that must be bridged, from syntax to intention.","title":"What a connector does"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is handed to a language model","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"Six components are drawn, and two of them, the orchestrator and the translator, are to be language models; the rest are a capability graph, a finder, and a workflow generator and executor that may be left out. How much of the chain is handed to a model is the real design variable.","title":"Its anatomy, and the model at its heart"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which barrier is claimed, which assumed","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Placed against the INTEROP framework, the proposal claims the conceptual and organisational barriers and declines the technical one, which it assumes is already solved. The claim is narrowed to semantics and governance, the two layers where a fixed standard hurts most.","title":"Where it claims to stand among the barriers"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000C9","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what was already built","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006T6"}],"prose":"An earlier framework from the same group supplies the three legs the connector stands on: AI for translation, simulation for validation, and mechanisms for adaptation. The present paper reads as that scaffold made into a holon.","title":"The authors' earlier scaffold"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CA","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"cost per added part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"}],"prose":"The costs named are the ones that scale with membership: agreement on protocols, latency of semantic reasoning, exposure of sensitive exchanges, and the governance to hold it all. Prediction and ledgers are offered as partial answers.","title":"What grows with the number of parts"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CB","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"who directs the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CF"}],"prose":"Simulation is turned inside out: the parts being simulated are also the ones steering the run, changing its rules and objectives as it proceeds. The novelty claimed is not a model but a change in who holds the controls of the trial.","title":"The rehearsal in which the actors direct"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CC","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which side of the run the agent stands on","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"}],"prose":"An agent may be the thing simulated, the helper of the simulator, or the monitor of the run. Holons inherit the three stances unchanged, and the paper adds a fourth word for the case where all three are held at once.","title":"Three stances toward a simulation"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CD","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the actors may change the rules","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"From passive to proactive, the scale measures how much the actors may alter the run: supplying data, adjusting parameters, learning across runs, rewriting the rules. The implementation notes and challenges are the price of climbing that scale.","title":"Degrees of direction"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CE","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"distance between actor and double","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"In the HLA setting each holon is given a federate as its double, and the connector's own double manages the federation with an authority that stops at the simulation's edge. Errors are flagged upward, results invalidated, and the run reinitialised, so the trial has its own small nesting inside the larger one.","title":"Doubles under a limited authority"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the gap between sketch and place","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000CM"}],"prose":"A sparsely settled region is the single place where every proposed piece is assigned a position and a task. It is a sketch rather than a trial, and what matters in reading it is the distance between the sketch and the ground it names.","title":"One territory where it is laid out"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CG","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what the absence reveals","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The second purpose of the platform is to locate places with no means of travel, which can only be seen as gaps in the routes the system computes. Absence is made visible by the shape of what is present.","title":"Finding what is absent"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CH","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which role each quality is cast in","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Each of the five qualities is cast in a role: travellers are understanding parts, transport services are unbiased and effective, infrastructure is vigilant, the communication channel is unbiased, and the connector holds the highest authority. The qualities become jobs the moment they meet a place.","title":"The casting"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the phase of the loop","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The system runs as a cycle: initialise the federation and its policies, exchange requests and conditions, adapt and optimise, validate and return. The same cycle is then replayed inside the simulation block, so one loop stands for two.","title":"The loop of a trip"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the claim a sketch licenses","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"Scalability, flexibility, fairness and lower emissions are all claimed for the territory, each by appeal to a property of the architecture rather than to an observation from the ground. The discussion licenses the claims by the drawing alone.","title":"What the sketch is said to show"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what remains to be shown","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000MX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"The closing pages say plainly that the roles are analytical constructs, the case is not a validation, and the hierarchies, evaluation methods and shared ontologies are still to be characterised. The paper ends by listing the parts of itself that are not yet held.","title":"What is admitted unfinished"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000CN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}